"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 41 of the 75 years since 1951, and November to December did too, in 41 years. This year started low there, with February to March 2026 at 11% of normal and March to April 2026 at 31%. June to July 2026 then ran 139% of normal. Grid 23522 had its driest year in 2002 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
